    {
        "content": "<p>Good to know, though really I was looking for a tactic that performs this specific step, so I can use it as a component of a larger search strategy (e.g. using Aesop).</p>\n<p>I think it probably doesn't exist in the library, so I've already begun writing my own tactic to do what I want, which is a great exercise anyway.  :)</p>",
